:: Forest - toll demand [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />


<<set _tollNpc = $guests[$forestTollEvent.npcIndex]>>
<<set _amount = $forestTollEvent.amount>>
<<newguy>>
<<set $tmpGuy.name = 'Stranger'>>

<center>
    <<image 'places/forest/forest_toll_demand.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

The message came through <<=setup.displayName(_tollNpc)>>. A man she passed on the path out — armed, unhurried. Polite about it, which somehow made it worse.
<br /><br />

<<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
    <<=_amount>> caps. Weekly. Your workers move through my stretch of forest without trouble. Miss a payment... accidents start happening. Trees fall funny out here.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />

He didn't give a name. Just said he'd know if you paid.
<br /><br />

<div id="ftd_pay">
<<linkreplace 'Pay the <<=_amount>> caps'>>
    <<run $('#ftd_refuse').hide()>>
    <<if $player.money >= _amount>>
        <<set $player.money -= _amount>>
        You left the caps at the treeline the next morning. No sign of the man, no acknowledgement — just the money gone by midday. Your workers moved through without incident after that. For now.
        <br /><br />
        <<set $forestTollEvent = null>>
        <strong>−<<=_amount>> caps</strong>
        <br /><br />
        <<link 'Continue'>>
            <<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
        <</link>>
    <<else>>
        You don't have enough caps.
    <</if>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="ftd_refuse">
<<linkreplace 'Refuse'>>
    <<run $('#ftd_pay').hide()>>
    You sent word back that you don't pay. Three days later, <<=setup.displayName(_tollNpc)>> came back from the forest with a split lip and two broken fingers. Her haul was gone. The point had been made.
    <br /><br />
    <<set _tollNpc.sick = {days: randomInteger(4, 8), desc: 'Beaten up', id: 'bruised'}>>
    <<set _tollNpc.happy = Math.max((_tollNpc.happy ?? 0) - 20, -100)>>
    <<set _tollNpc.relationship = Math.max((_tollNpc.relationship ?? 0) - 10, -100)>>
    <<set $forestTollEvent.refused = true>>
    <strong>(<<=setup.displayName(_tollNpc)>>: Happy −20, Relationship −10, sick <<=_tollNpc.sick.days>> days)</strong>
    <br /><br />
    <div id="ftd_hunt"><<linkreplace 'Hunt them down'>>
        <<run $('#ftd_letgo').hide()>>
        <<set $forestTollEvent = null>>
        <<goto 'Forest - toll retaliation'>>
    <</linkreplace>></div>
    <div id="ftd_letgo"><<linkreplace 'Let it go'>>
        <<run $('#ftd_hunt').hide()>>
        <<set $forestTollEvent = null>>
        You swallow it. For now.
        <br /><br />
        <<link 'Continue'>>
            <<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
        <</link>>
    <</linkreplace>></div>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
